# Seedship Impact: the Lander depends on the target's mana value, not on whether it was destroyed. Bot2's Ornithopter (an
# artifact creature, mana value 0) is the target; in response Bot2 casts Boros Charm for "permanents you control gain
# indestructible until end of turn". The destroy does nothing (CR 702.12b), the Ornithopter stays, and Bot1 still creates a
# Lander because the mana value was 2 or less.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Seedship Impact
Forest x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Ornithopter
Boros Charm
Mountain x16

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
